WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.820
So this is how many of these people, these
mentors

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:08.320
that I had were women.

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:13.500
They were mainly women, and they were some
of the most powerful women

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:14.640
in Manchester at

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:16.400
the time, and even afterwards.

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:21.240
And so they sort of got me involved,
they'd say, read some poetry,

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:23.260
do this, or help us

00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:27.660
to organise this, put on a theatre
company, put on a dance group,

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:28.520
do all of that.

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:33.720
and because of that it also got me into
working in

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:34.920
entertainment at the

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:39.320
University and working in a theatre as a
theatre manager.
